@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Filter Restaurants

' Aceasta diagrama detaliaza cazul de utilizare "Filter Restaurants"
' si operatia RestaurantFilters.filter()
'
' Conform cerintelor (Punctul 9 din rubrica), acest scenariu este validat de 
' urmatoarele teste JUnit:
' - RestaurantFiltersTest.filterByCuisineAndAvailability()
' - RestaurantFiltersTest.filterByDietaryTagAndPrice()

start

:Receive List of Restaurants and FilterCriteria;

:Initialize an empty Output List;

while (More Restaurants in List?) is (Yes)
  :Get Next Restaurant;
  
  if (Criteria: onlyAvailable == True AND Restaurant is Closed?) then (Yes)
    :Skip Restaurant;
  elseif (Criteria: has CuisineType AND Cuisine mismatches?) then (Yes)
    :Skip Restaurant;
  elseif (Criteria: has DietaryTag AND menu lacks tag?) then (Yes)
    :Skip Restaurant;
  elseif (Criteria: has PriceRange AND PriceRange mismatches?) then (Yes)
    :Skip Restaurant;
  else (No filter failed)
    :Add Restaurant to Output List;
  endif
  
endwhile (No)

:Return Output List;

stop
@enduml
